Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:02.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.71,0:00:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:12.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师与珊瑚之间 似有似无的微妙关系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然珊瑚说他们两个人之间什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:24.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我却觉得他们之间感觉还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:29.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:36.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:49.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:55.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:01:01.96,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:06.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:14.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:19.51,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:23.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.09,0:01:28.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:32.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.10,0:01:35.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:40.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:47.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:49.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第131话 观音的挂轴 诅咒的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说都是鬼女的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:08.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有骗你们 昨天晚上我亲眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我去山中采药草
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心迷路的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:15.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到处徘徊 不知不觉走到了沼泽地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到一群女人搬了一个东西过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就把那个东西丢进沼泽里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那会是什么东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看那绝对是死尸没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且皮好像都已经被剥掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是人类能做出来的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鬼 一定是鬼女做的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼女啊 听起来真恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这附近感觉不到那么强烈的邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:44.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 有没有四魂之玉碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是没有四魂之玉碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是不要去那么危险的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该对每一个可疑的地方都要查清楚才对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要在奈落之前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:59.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到四魂之玉碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的目的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不能让他完成污秽的四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位姑娘 请问这附近有村庄吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武士大人 您受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚从战争之中逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.25,0:04:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子还真是有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您觉得哪里奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我刚才来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到的就只有女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:56.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这个村子里并没有男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都死在战场上了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:03.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 因为战争啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 来吧 请武士大人先用个餐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 怎么会连个小孩跟老人都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:25.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这个武士带到供奉观音菩萨的佛堂去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是…是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:44.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我睡着了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…佛堂里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是为什么这里面好像闪着光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.81,0:06:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才我的确是感觉到了邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说是邪气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只有一瞬间 但是我确实感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里好像就是刚才那位老伯说的鬼女沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:11.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可能就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么奇怪的东西漂过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:21.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难…难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.35,0:07:30.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 还没死
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能别那么粗鲁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫筱助
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:38.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 请用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.99,0:07:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛 一脸苦闷的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这样说人家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:50.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你在寻找下落不明 遍寻不着的未婚妻是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:56.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是在距离婚礼三天之前的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被迫上了战场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来受到很重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整整两年时间没办法回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.52,0:08:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好不容易回到了生长的故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到村子已经被烧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.36,0:08:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的未婚妻若菜也不知去向
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然她生死不明 我还是到处找她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:20.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在快要绝望的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说这附近有一个只有女人的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有女人的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.41,0:08:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还听说那个村子里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:32.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是在战争中失去了孩子丈夫的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家相依为命在那里生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 我在想说不定若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在也在那个村落里生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像跟鬼女村落有什么关系耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为村子都是只有女人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我们跟你同行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 我根本不知道在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看 对方好像已经主动找过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这里的确就是在战争中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:12.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去孩子跟丈夫的女人的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里互相扶持勉强度日
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 这里没有你要找的那位叫若菜的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有在这里耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:27.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:29.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会继续找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不能放弃的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:37.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够跟我共度一生的伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有若菜一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是专情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:42.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真叫人羡慕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有别的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有感觉到妖气还是邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:04.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的鼻子只有闻到水的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.47,0:10:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻不到其他什么可疑的气味…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:09.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有女人的生活 一定很没有安全感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有在听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:12.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.48,0:10:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看他这样子应该没有发现邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:19.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过有杀气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 我们是不是差不多该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.36,0:10:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这个地方应该不是我们要找的鬼女村吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下 旅行的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走夜路是很危险的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我们没什么东西可以招待你们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们今天晚上就住在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 那我们恭敬不如从命了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 姑娘们请跟我们一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男士们请走这边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:47.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要分开睡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:52.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看我们还是继续上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你一口答应人家要住下来的不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:00.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们一起住你不满意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个荒凉的村落就只有女人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以偶尔有客人来 我们也会很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:15.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 请好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 今天不用餐风露宿了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话是这么说没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来应该尽快去找鬼女村才对的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:30.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师真是的 又露出好色的本性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在哪里 若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,筱助 你还活着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:52.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为你已经战死了 所以才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:56.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想回到心爱的男人身边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:57.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:11:59.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就让你跟他见面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 必须在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.19,0:12:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了我去把男人带来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:10.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底对珊瑚是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前去白灵山的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:19.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是只有你跟珊瑚两个人独处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.07,0:12:21.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说那个时候的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候什么事都没有发生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:24.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是风之使者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:40.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.33,0:12:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要撑下去 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.73,0:12:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是让人感动呀 法师
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是一个人先走的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才能多活一会儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:02.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法发动风穴了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在怕那些毒虫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.65,0:13:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也未免太小看我弥勒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了自己心爱的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要我赴汤蹈火
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拼了这条命不要也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:29.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虫毒…开始扩散了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 什么事都没发生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有没有 都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.95,0:13:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你跟弥勒法师真的没什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指没有什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为上次在白灵山的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个人不是一直独处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.68,0:14:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那段时间 没有留下什么美好的回忆吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你还是先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只有你…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不走 要走也要一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这一次 我有点勉强过度了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:27.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 至少也要让你活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其把你留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿陪你一起死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:36.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:42.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在情不自禁的情况下说了那些话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:43.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过在那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师的态度好像一点都没有改变啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:49.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的什么事都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没有啦 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟弥勒法师之间不是你想的那种关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是珊瑚 你应该是喜欢弥勒法师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这怎么可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会喜欢那种到处勾搭女生的色狼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是心事都很清楚地写在脸上了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做事毫无分寸、又轻佻、还面不改色的说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.68,0:15:16.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我觉得弥勒法师其实他是很喜欢你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为…为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你对他来说很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他很重视你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧 云母也这么觉得对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:40.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:42.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:44.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的丈夫因为战争去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:49.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能成为你心灵的上慰借
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:50.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时都可以奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很高兴 法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.53,0:16:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.03,0:16:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这样让弥勒走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:06.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管他了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:10.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比听他整个晚上在这边唉声叹气来的好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚一定会生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说你…真的是个大傻瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:20.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要先休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算明天一大早就离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再去其他地方找我的未婚妻若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:31.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你自便吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:39.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚好可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:41.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过其实她不用硬撑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接阻止弥勒法师就好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟过去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:04.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我去叫犬夜叉跟弥勒法师过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们一定就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 现在没有时间去找他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股气味是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.39,0:17:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 应该不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是水中生物的味道 而且数量还不少
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.47,0:17:47.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睡你们的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 珊瑚一个人追过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水中生物的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:59.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然还不知道是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个气味突然扑鼻而来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕就在那些女人开始行动的同一时间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,筱助
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若菜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我找你找得有多辛苦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 请往这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在佛堂里面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是会遭到观音菩萨惩罚的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么多人一下子跑到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:36.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.25,0:19:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚会在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的气味突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定是遁入水里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.43,0:19:55.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 往后退
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:04.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你们 你们把珊瑚怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你们敢把她藏起来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们的嘴里好像吐出了一股邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是有什么人在背后控制她们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你千万不能伤害她们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞了半天 我们还是不知不觉中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:30.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了什么鬼女村了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师大人 请你好好安慰我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然有邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.38,0:20:43.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的肚子里有什么东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 为什么每次都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:48.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:51.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你只是被人控制住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:53.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才是幕后主使者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:20:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 你是什么妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:02.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的人皮交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:04.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说人皮？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.95,0:21:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就可以让你也加入我们的行列
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.43,0:21:35.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是什么动物的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 把它吞下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要咬 直接吞下去就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.34,0:21:49.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过不了多久 蛋就会在你的肚子里孵化出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.65,0:21:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候你就能够成为我们的伙伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:57.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可…可恶 谁要吃这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:24.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:40.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:47.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.02,0:22:50.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.54,0:22:56.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:06.72,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:14.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:18.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:22.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.77,0:23:29.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.50,0:23:53.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚被妖怪控制住 竟然开始攻击弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.50,0:23:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个怎么能够反目成仇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.44,0:23:56.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吞了那个奇怪的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上救你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.77,0:24:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起鬼女村的女人 你果然没那么容易对付
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.18,0:24:03.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.21,0:24:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你为敌 真的是一件很可怕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:09.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我也不能束手就擒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师最危险的告白
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.06,0:24:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说 你是最特别的女人
